Azerbaijan, China and Vietnam because her mother worked for the World Healt=
h Organization, and now lives in Canada. She=E2=80=99s a third-culture kid =
who had to try out her jokes in international schools.</span></p><p style=
=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>I=
