ually inspired by her German mum.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25=
px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>=E2=80=9COh, like 99 per=
cent,=E2=80=9D she said. =E2=80=9CJust the other week she told me out of th=
e blue: =E2=80=98I don=E2=80=99t think muffins should ever have been invent=
ed.=E2=80=99 And then she added, =E2=80=98and that=E2=80=99s just a fact.=
=E2=80=99 So I write that down.=E2=80=9D</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal =
17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Ramoso says she d=
oesn=E2=80=99t do political satire. =E2=80=9CI used to feel bad about not b=
eing the kind of comedian who makes jokes about politics,=E2=80=9D she told=
 me. =E2=80=9CBut my favorite kind of comedy is observational satire: takin=
g the microscope and looking at human behavior and amplifying it.=E2=80=9D<=
/span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin=
:0 0 15px"><span>That=E2=80=99s my favorite thing about her comedy too. It=
